    "body": "Times of each test alone, in debug, with the `--exact` filter, on `origin/main` 37aca7f8c (CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=6, -j 6, no other test in the run):\n\n- `solidcraft_sample_meshes_within_the_app_chord` (camcraft-kernel, `--test machining_mesh`): 39.04 s.\n- `launch_file_tests::a_solidcraft_design_is_imported` (camcraft-ui, `--lib`): 38.79 s.\n\nThe two tests are below the limit of about 60 s in AGENTS.md \"Testing\". The earlier times (128.7 s and more) came from parallel runs. No move to the heavy lane and no smaller fixture is necessary. I changed no code and opened no PR.\n\nI release the claim. The issue can close as not needed.\n",
